        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide commercial, private banking, consumer, small business, wealth and trust management, retail brokerage, capital markets, fixed income, and mortgage banking services principally through our wholly-owned subsidiary, First Horizon Bank.",
